{"chapter": "etale-cohomology", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0DDB", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to Y$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0003": "$X_\\etale$", "MATH_0004": "$R^nf_*\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0005": "$Y_\\etale$", "MATH_0006": "$n$", "MATH_0007": "$K$", "MATH_0008": "$D^+(X_\\etale)$", "MATH_0009": "$Rf_*K$", "MATH_0010": "$D^+(Y_\\etale)$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-torsion-direct-image}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:5f9fd29fd75a3b9e1949f61ab56b17c2b4dbe48d3581955b5081ceae12b08332", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:6088500bb3aea7e997e21b006196dcd37aaf8466a5f9fa29e5dff393baa4c38a", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a quasi-compact and quasi-separated\nmorphism of schemes.\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> If <MATH_0002> is a torsion abelian sheaf on <MATH_0003>, then\n<MATH_0004> is a torsion abelian sheaf on <MATH_0005> for all <MATH_0006>.\n<STRUCT_0003> If <MATH_0007> in <MATH_0008> has torsion cohomology sheaves, then\n<MATH_0009> is an object of <MATH_0010> whose cohomology sheaves are\ntorsion abelian sheaves.\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:ef55ed9850096b05ec9705f58b52f18180fd931629e89e45b3f6513e63119b2c", "unit_id": "tag:0DDD:statement"}
